I've just been source diving, and he must be hit with a *+4* or better
weapon.  I think enchanted gauntlets have the same effect, however.

> > Are you sure it was a gray unicorn?  I've had no gray unicorns but
> > plenty of white ones.  IIRC, the level of minion you get is affected
> > by your character's level, but there's a random factor too.
> > Eva.
> 
> Positive.  The level of the unicorn seemed to max out at 6.  I usually
> play neutrals -- alignment would affect which you receive, correct? 
> What alignment where you when you received your unicorns?

I was lawful, but more source diving has shown that all alignments can
get their appropriate colour of unicorn.  It must just be that lawfuls
can get minions by praying as well as sacrificing, so my lawfuls get
minions earlier and are therefore more likely to get a mere unicorn.

> Sort of off topic, but I'm curious... I was exicted by the possibility
